
This directory is for PlatformIO tests and standalone test firmware.

## Tests

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `test_xy_motors` | Serial jog: `x12`, `x-12`, `y50`, `y-3` |
| `test_endstop` | Endstop state monitor on serial |

More information: https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
